### Phase 6 — Structured Output Schema

#### [NEW] `schemas.py`
```python
class Citation(BaseModel):
    source: str          # PDF filename or URL
    page: int            # For Verification Deck
    snippet: str         # Exact quote
    source_type: str     # "rag" | "web"

class LegalResponse(BaseModel):
    summary: str                  # 2-3 sentence executive summary
    citations: list[Citation]     # Maps to Verification Deck
    draft_text: str | None        # Only populated for drafting requests
    confidence: float             # 0.0 - 1.0, from hallucination checker
    source_type: str              # "rag" | "web" | "hybrid" | "unverified"
    answer: str                   # Full legal analysis (markdown)
```

